#: src/idiomatic/foundations-api-design/predictable-api/naming-conventions/into.md:6
msgid "`into`"
msgstr ""

#: src/idiomatic/foundations-api-design/predictable-api/naming-conventions/into.md:8
msgid ""
"Prefix for methods that convert `self` into another type. Consumes `self`, "
"returns an owned value."
msgstr ""

#: src/idiomatic/foundations-api-design/predictable-api/naming-conventions/into.md:12
msgid "// Copyright 2025 Google LLC\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/idiomatic/foundations-api-design/predictable-api/naming-conventions/into.md:13
msgid "// SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/idiomatic/foundations-api-design/predictable-api/naming-conventions/into.md:26
msgid ""
"Prefix for a function that consumes an owned value and transforms it into a "
"value of another type."
msgstr ""

#: src/idiomatic/foundations-api-design/predictable-api/naming-conventions/into.md:29
msgid ""
"Not reinterpret cast! The data can be rearranged, reallocated, changed in "
"any way, including losing information."
msgstr ""

#: src/idiomatic/foundations-api-design/predictable-api/naming-conventions/into.md:32
msgid ""
"`into_iter` consumes a collection (like a vec, or a btreeset, or a hashmap) "
"and produces an iterator over owned values, unlike `iter` and `iter_mut` "
"which produce iterators over reference values."
msgstr ""
